#. ここの階は、なんも変わりねーべ…
msgctxt "0001 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Nothing's changed on this floor."
msgstr ""

#. ただ、３階への階段のシャッターが開いてたぞ。
msgctxt "0002 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"The only difference is the gate blocking the stairs\n"
"leading up to the 3rd floor is gone."
msgstr ""

#. きっと、３階に行けるようになったんだべ。
#. そっちに色々とありそうだべ！
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I guess that's where they want us to head next. I\n"
"wonder what kinda crazy stuff is up there...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここは女子トイレだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is the girls bathroom.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな所に入ったら最後…
#. みんなから軽蔑されて終わりだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I ever took one step in there, I'd become a total\n"
"creep in everyone's eyes, and that'd be it for me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
